      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹5.46 (vs ₹3.41 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹5.46 (up from ₹3.41 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹105.4b (up 16% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹5.93b (up 60% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 5.6% (up from 4.1% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Revenue is forecast to grow 5.4% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 10% growth forecast for the Food industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 24% per year whereas the company’s share price has increased by 19% per year.",
